(SALESFORCE ORCHESTRATOR MIGRATION GUIDE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Purpose) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This guide documents how to migrate Salesforce reverse ETL orchestration from Airflow-style) Tj
T*
(custom tasks to the Databricks Salesforce orchestrator in this repository.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Scope:) Tj
T*
(- function-based execution) Tj
T*
(- operator-based execution) Tj
T*
(- Unity Catalog connection-based authentication) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Migration Summary) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Source Pattern \(Airflow/Custom\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Typical legacy flow:) Tj
T*
(1. extract records from warehouse or table) Tj
T*
(2. call Salesforce client/custom script) Tj
T*
(3. manually manage batching, retries, and polling) Tj
T*
(4. surface success/failure in scheduler logs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Common issues:) Tj
T*
(- repeated custom logic per DAG) Tj
T*
(- inconsistent error handling and observability) Tj
T*
(- credential sprawl) Tj
T*
(- difficult standardization across teams) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Target Pattern \(Databricks\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use the package primitives in salesforce_integration:) Tj
T*
(- Functions:) Tj
T*
(  - salesforce_upsert) Tj
T*
(  - salesforce_insert) Tj
T*
(  - salesforce_update) Tj
T*
(  - salesforce_delete) Tj
T*
(- Operators:) Tj
T*
(  - SalesforceBulkWriteOperator) Tj
T*
(  - SalesforceUpsertOperator) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Concept Mapping) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Legacy concept | Databricks equivalent |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Airflow PythonOperator for write | python_operator_task with) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
3 0 obj
<< /Length 1897 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
50 742 Td
(salesforce_integration.salesforce_* |) Tj
T*
(| Airflow custom operator | python_operator_task with) Tj
T*
(salesforce_integration.SalesforceBulkWriteOperator |) Tj
T*
(| Scheduler variable/connection secrets | Unity Catalog connection \(conn_id\) |) Tj
T*
(| Manual polling loop in DAG code | Operator poll\(\) lifecycle |) Tj
T*
(| Custom cleanup logic | Operator close\(\) lifecycle |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Migration Path A: Function Workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended when you want straightforward task-per-operation execution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example task shape) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    python_operator_task:) Tj
T*
(      main: salesforce_integration.salesforce_upsert) Tj
T*
(      parameters:) Tj
T*
(        - name: object_name) Tj
T*
(          value: "Account") Tj
T*
(        - name: external_id_field) Tj
T*
(          value: "Account_Number_External__c") Tj
T*
(        - name: records) Tj
T*
(          value: '[{"Account_Number_External__c":"A001","Name":"Acme"}]') Tj
T*
(        - name: conn_id) Tj
T*
(          value: "salesforce_m2m_conn") Tj
T*
(        - name: wait_for_completion) Tj
T*
(          value: "true") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use this path when) Tj
T*
(- each task can run to completion in one call) Tj
T*
(- minimal orchestration complexity is needed) Tj
T*
(- you want simplest migration from direct script calls) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Migration Path B: Operator Workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended when you need lifecycle semantics \(open/poll/close\) for external orchestration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example task shape) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    python_operator_task:) Tj
T*
(      main: salesforce_integration.SalesforceBulkWriteOperator) Tj
T*
(      parameters:) Tj
T*
(        - name: object_name) Tj
T*
(          value: "Account") Tj
T*
(        - name: operation) Tj
T*
(          value: "upsert") Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
