(        - name: external_id_field) Tj
T*
(          value: "Account_Number_External__c") Tj
T*
(        - name: records) Tj
T*
(          value: '[{"Account_Number_External__c":"A001","Name":"Acme"}]') Tj
T*
(        - name: conn_id) Tj
T*
(          value: "salesforce_m2m_conn") Tj
T*
(        - name: task_key) Tj
T*
(          value: "upsert_with_operator") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use this path when) Tj
T*
(- you need explicit long-running external lifecycle management) Tj
T*
(- you want standardized polling and cleanup behavior) Tj
T*
(- you are replacing custom Airflow operator-style code) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Authentication Migration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Move from raw credentials to Unity Catalog connection references:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Old: username/password/token in scheduler variables or env vars) Tj
T*
(- New: conn_id to UC connection configured in workspace) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Result:) Tj
T*
(- centralized governance) Tj
T*
(- no credentials in pipeline code) Tj
T*
(- easier rotation and control) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Data Contract Expectations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Records parameter) Tj
T*
(- pass JSON string \(Databricks task parameter\)) Tj
T*
(- function/operator coerces to list of dicts) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Field requirements) Tj
T*
(- upsert requires external_id_field) Tj
T*
(- update/delete require Salesforce Id field in each record) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CSV formatting) Tj
T*
(- orchestrator emits Salesforce-compatible LF line endings) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Validation Checklist) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- [ ] UC connection configured and accessible) Tj
T*
(- [ ] conn_id points to M2M-ready Salesforce connection) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
