T*
() Tj
T*
(Run operator path:) Tj
T*
(    databricks bundle run salesforce_upsert_operator --profile dogfood) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Notes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- This repository intentionally excludes Salesforce sensor implementation.) Tj
T*
(- Migration scope is function/operator only.) Tj
T*
